{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle structure carefully. The key constraint is \"the award itself was originally created in the 2000s.\" The Booker Prize was created in 1969, so it doesn't fit. The Man Booker International Prize was inaugurated in 2005 (the 2000s). \n\nBut Obioma's books were shortlisted for the regular Booker Prize, not the International one. Let me reconsider. Perhaps the puzzle is about a different award entirely. Let me think about awards created in the 2000s:\n- Man Booker International Prize (2005)\n- The Story Prize (2004)\n- Baileys Women's Prize for Fiction (1996 - no)\n\nLet me reconsider the structure. Maybe Book A is a contender for an award created in the 2000s, and in the year Book A was published, Book B won that same award. Let me look at the Man Booker International Prize winners in the 2010s and find a book translated into 25+ languages that was a contender.\n\nLet me check the 2019 Man Booker International Prize winner and shortlist.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Booker International Prize 2019 winner shortlist\", \"International Booker Prize 2010s winners list\", \"book translated 25 languages shortlisted Man Booker International Prize 2010s\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_45c9a0d494004bf98d88047b","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": \"\\\"The Vegetarian\\\" Han Kang translated languages award, \\\"The Discomfort of Evening\\\" Marieke Lucas Rijneveld translated languages, \\\"Flights\\\" Olga Tokarczuk translated languages International Booker\"}","name":"search"},"id":"call_c0b88d3b1f27482a85e77b0c","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789472928,"id":"chatcmpl-5c835e17-8ab8-93ed-8dd0-f289e3b27e77","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19183,"completion_tokens":324,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":19507,"cached_tokens":14976,"prompt_token